@base = http://localhost:8000

### health
GET {{base}}/health

### generate and save a recipe
POST {{base}}/recipes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Spaghetti Carbonara",
  "description": "A classic Italian pasta dish"
}

### list saved recipes
GET {{base}}/recipes

### fetch one saved recipe
GET {{base}}/recipes/1

### unknown recipe -> 404
GET {{base}}/recipes/999999

### invalid body -> 422
POST {{base}}/recipes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "description": ""
}
